Project Request: Database System for Income and Tax Calculation

I need a simple database system to be built with the following specifications:

Core Purpose:
Track individuals' income and automatically calculate their tax liability based on a specific rule.

Data to Store (Tables/Fields):

People Table:

Person ID (Unique, Auto-generated)

Full Name

(Optional: Contact info, date added)

Income & Tax Table (linked to People Table):

Record ID

Person ID (Link to the person)

Salary/Income Amount (a number field)

Tax Rate Applied (to be auto-calculated)

Tax Amount (to be auto-calculated)

Net Income (Income - Tax Amount, can be auto-calculated)

Calculation Date

The Core Rule (Business Logic):

If Income is LESS than 30,000: The tax rate is 5%.

If Income is 30,000 or MORE: The tax rate is 10%.

Functional Requirements:

Data Entry Form: A simple way to input/register a person and their income.

Automatic Calculation: When an income is entered or updated, the system must:

Check the amount against the 30,000 threshold.

Apply the correct tax rate (5% or 10%).

Calculate the Tax Amount (Income * Rate) and Net Income.

Save all this information automatically.

View & Manage Data: A page/interface to see all records (People, their Income, Applied Tax Rate, Tax Amount, Net Income).

Edit & Update: Ability to edit a person's name or update their income. When income is updated, the tax should recalculate automatically.

Delete: Ability to remove records.

Export/Download Data: A crucial feature. I need to be able to download the entire list (or filtered data) in a common format like Excel (.xlsx) or CSV.

Technical Preference (for the developer):

A clean, simple web interface is perfect.

Please use a common and reliable database like PostgreSQL, MySQL, or even SQLite.

The logic for the tax calculation must be reliable and run on the server-side or securely in the database.

Deliverable:
A fully functional web application with the features above, including the ability to add, view, edit, delete, and download the income and tax data.
